// Package commondao provides a reference realm implementation of the
// gno.land/p/nt/commondao/v0 package for managing Decentralized Autonomous
// Organizations per the Common DAO Spec: DAO and sub-DAO trees with
// councils and charters, a governable registry of proposal kinds (ten
// defaults plus an opt-in arbitrary-execution kind), per-DAO treasuries on
// derived sub-identity addresses with ancestor clawback/freeze powers, and
// bylaws documents amended by verifiable diff patches. See README.md and
// the ADRs under gno.land/adr/ for the design record.
package commondao
